        "dropdown_16": {
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "open": false,
            "pending_text": "",
            "show_pending": false,
            "text": "<p>Most snacks packed for a day out are a compromise, given because there is nothing else to hand. Yummybara is made to be the snack you are glad to hand over. Each age gets a texture it can manage: melts that soften as soon as they touch saliva at 8 months+, baked rusks that hold their shape at 10 months+, and real crunch at 12 months+. Every snack is organic, halal certified, and made with no preservatives and no added refined sugar or salt. Each one comes in its own snack-sized pack, sealed one by one, so a few go in the bag for the zoo or a long car ride.</p>",
            "title": "Tell me more"
          },
          "type": "dropdown"
        },
        "dropdown_17": {
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "See every box in this bundle",
            "open": false,
            "pending_text": "<p><strong>Allergens:</strong> the melts contain milk. The Jumbo Filled Rice Sticks contain wheat, milk and egg. The Shrimp Wafer Crisps contain crustaceans. Some products are made in a facility that also handles soybean, peanuts, tree nuts, fish and crustaceans. Every box lists them.</p>",
            "show_pending": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>First Melts, 8 months+:</strong> yoghurt, cereal, coconut milk and cheese melts, plus freeze-dried rice rusks.</p><p><strong>First Bites, 10 months+:</strong> baked rice rusks, plus the melts from First Melts.</p><p><strong>Big Crunch, 12 months+:</strong> filled rice sticks, puff pops, DHA puff rice sticks, shrimp wafer crisps, dark chocolate melts, triangle corn puffs and freeze-dried fruit.</p>",
            "title": "What's inside"
          },
          "type": "dropdown"
        },
        "dropdown_18": {
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "open": false,
            "pending_text": "<p>Keep in a cool, dry place, away from heat and sunlight.</p>",
            "show_pending": false,
            "text": "<p>Pick the bundle for your child's age. If they are between two ages, pick the younger one.</p><p>Always stay with your child while they eat.</p>",
