    "hlt_faq": {
      "block_order": [
        "question_1",
        "question_2",
        "question_3",
        "question_4",
        "question_5",
        "question_6",
        "question_7",
        "question_8",
        "question_9",
        "question_10",
        "question_11",
        "question_12",
        "question_13"
      ],
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>First Melts, 8 months+. Everything in it melts. Move up to First Bites when your child is holding food and gnawing on it, usually around 10 months. If you are between two ages, pick the younger one.</p>",
            "question": "My child is 9 months. Which bundle?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_10": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Free on every bundle. We pack your order in 1 to 2 business days, and J&amp;T delivers in another 1 to 2. Singapore only.</p>",
            "question": "How fast is delivery?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_11": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Yes. About 10% less for Standard and about 15 to 17% less for the Value pack. The bought separately price sits beside every size.</p>",
            "question": "Is a bundle cheaper than buying the boxes one by one?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_12": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>One pack of Habibara Pure &amp; Gentle Baby Wet Wipes (80 sheets) and a 3-pack of Habibara Pure &amp; Gentle Baby Wipes (25 sheets each), worth S$8.75. It comes in the same delivery.</p>",
            "question": "What is the free gift with the Value pack?",
            "show": false
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_13": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Not for now. The bundles are set for each age, so every box suits your child.</p>",
            "question": "Can I choose my own boxes?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_2": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>First Bites. Big Crunch has filled sticks and wafers that need proper chewing. Move up at 12 months, or later if your child is still working on chewing.</p>",
            "question": "My child is 11 months. First Bites or Big Crunch?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_3": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Some are. The rusks, rice sticks and puffs are rice snacks, and we say so. The melts are made with yoghurt, cheese or coconut milk, and the freeze-dried fruit is made from fruit. Every one is made with no added refined sugar or salt.</p>",
            "question": "Aren't baby snacks just carbs?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_4": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Fruit is a great snack. A sealed pack just needs less fuss on the go: no washing or cutting, and nothing bruises at the bottom of the bag.</p>",
            "question": "Why not just bring fruit?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_5": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Every bundle has at least 10 different snacks, so one miss still leaves plenty to try.</p>",
            "question": "What if my child doesn't like a flavour?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_6": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>First Melts is made for 8 months+. The melts are freeze-dried, so they soften as soon as they touch saliva. As with any food, stay with your child while they eat.</p>",
            "question": "Are the melts right for a baby who is just starting?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_7": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every Yummybara snack is organic, halal certified, and made with no preservatives and no added refined sugar or salt.</p>",
            "question": "Is it organic and halal?",
            "show": true
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_8": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Yes, and every box lists them. The melts contain milk. The Jumbo Filled Rice Sticks contain wheat, milk and egg. The Shrimp Wafer Crisps contain crustaceans. Some products are made in a facility that also handles soybean, peanuts, tree nuts, fish and crustaceans. Check the box for your child's allergy before serving.</p>",
            "question": "Does it contain allergens?",
            "show": false
          },
          "type": "question"
        },
        "question_9": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Cool, dry place, away from heat and sunlight. Unopened, the melts keep 18 months and most other products 12 months.</p>",
            "question": "How do I store it, and how long does it keep?",
            "show": false
          },
          "type": "question"
        }
      },
